already know me, I'm Lynn Cooley,

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:14.193
the Dean of the Graduate
School of Arts and Sciences.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:18.820
I'm very pleased to welcome
you to our first presentation

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.670
in a series of conversations

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.290
with Yale Graduate School Alumni,

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:27.560
sponsored by the graduate
school and its alumni board.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.720
