00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.750
I have ambitious goals for transforming

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.310
and evolving Yale's approach
to doctoral education,

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.070
as well as plans to strengthen

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.590
and build our alumni community,

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.050
to connect our faculty, administrators,

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.280
and students more frequently,

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.250
and to help ignite these connections

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.993
in support of our students.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.830
I look forward to using what
we learned from this series

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.410
to think about how we can continue

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.323
to improve graduate student
experiences for all students.

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:20.880
So today we will be joined
by Charles D. Brown II,

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.193
PhD alumnus from the
Department of Physics,

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.510
