Dean for Graduate Student Life

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.223
in the graduate school.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.110
We hope that you will
enjoy this conversation

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:43.220
about Charles's scholarship

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.670
and the lessons he has learned

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.750
from his days as a
graduate student at Yale.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.700
I'm really glad to have graduate students,

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.610
alumni and faculty and old
friends of Charles tuning in,

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:55.220
