00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:34.000
- Thank you very much, Matthew,

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.080
thank you, Dean Lynn Cooley,
thank you for this opportunity.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:42.080
So I am the vice chair of the
Graduate School Alumni Board,

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.360
and I'm delighted to have this opportunity

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:48.020
to pose a first question
