00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:52.590
Charles, I noticed actually
last week you gave a talk

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.590
at our physics club

00:03:55.860 --> 00:04:00.860
about a complex topic of
lattice trapped quantum gas,

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.730
so very interesting.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.450
I wonder whether the talk
was virtual, in person

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.080
