conversation tonight,

00:55:14.340 --> 00:55:17.520
and also to all the students
and alumni who joined us,

00:55:17.520 --> 00:55:19.640
thank you for being here.

00:55:19.640 --> 00:55:22.003
Thanks also to my colleagues, Yasmina

00:55:22.003 --> 00:55:24.230
(indistinct), Regan and Kathleen Galo

00:55:24.230 --> 00:55:27.440
for all their hard work in
putting this event together,

00:55:27.440 --> 00:55:29.310
along with the GSAA.

00:55:29.310 --> 00:55:31.800
I hope everyone has
enjoyed the conversation

00:55:31.800 --> 00:55:34.840
and will continue to help us
build a stronger community

00:55:34.840 --> 00:55:37.550
among graduate student's
faculty, and alumni.

00:55:37.550 --> 00:55:40.050
So thank you again,
especially Charles, thank you.

00:55:40.970 --> 00:55:42.700
We hope that you'll all join us

00:55:42.700 --> 00:55:44.930
